{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/af35c1fc736a49cc4a6747e6b967692f.poster.avif?t=1655411985\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/af35c1fc736a49cc4a6747e6b967692f.webm?t=1655411985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/af35c1fc736a49cc4a6747e6b967692f.mp4?t=1655411985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Born from a Game Jam, Space Maxwell is an arcade shooter videogame and your mission is to shoot the right laser to the right enemy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/b7baf54ce2d46303d10251bc2d53169d.poster.avif?t=1655411985\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/b7baf54ce2d46303d10251bc2d53169d.webm?t=1655411985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/b7baf54ce2d46303d10251bc2d53169d.mp4?t=1655411985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your spaceship has blue and red lasers, each one for a type of enemy. Shoot them at the wrong enemy and they will multiply. It's chaotic!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/8eb75e056234bc8a9ad8d89544cb7ed4.poster.avif?t=1655411985\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882780/extras/8eb75e056234bc8a9ad8d89544cb7ed4.webm?t=1655411985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc